# The glass pack's main pass says in its own header that it is a FULL PORT of
# kwin-effects-glass, naming that project's glass.glsl, snells-glass.glsl and
# oklab.glsl, so upstream is credited rather than relicensed away. Its own stanza
# AFTER the group above rather than inside it, because DEP-5 is last-match-wins
# and a group listing it would override the credit. Better Blur is credited in the
# file's prose only: what is taken from it is an idea, not a body.
