# The vibrancy helper in this shared header is a port of Hyprland's blur1.glsl,
# whose BSD-3 terms permit the LGPL the file ships under. BSD-3 requires the
# upstream notice be retained in a source redistribution, and shader sources are
# shipped as source, so upstream is credited here and in the file's own header
# rather than relicensed away. The retained notice is the BSD-3-Clause paragraph
# at the foot of this file; the License field stays LGPL-2.1-or-later because
# that is what the file ships under.
